  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Sector Reform and Strengthening Initiative Programmatic Multi Donor Trust Fund for Lower Income Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The objective of the Trust Fund is to support low-income countries to improve the stability, efficiency, inclusiveness and depth of their financial sectors by providing medium-term technical assistance in prudential supervision, financial inclusion, and market development.
 
 The objectives, basic principles, activities and governance arrangements of FIRST and which apply to the Trust Fund are described in the FIRST Charter, which was adopted on July 6, 2007 and amended on July 11, 2013.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
